## Current limitations

- Layout/text is measurement-assisted but still imperfect; ticks are numeric-first.
- Marker/tooltip placement and viewport-edge behavior are still basic.
- Accessibility: semantics + focus opt-in + custom actions + optional cartesian keyboard viewport shortcuts + configurable selection live region; keyboard selection roam and marker focus handoff are light; animation transitions not implemented.
- iOS: same pipeline as Android; Roborazzi is Android-only; device soak is manual.
